# Build context for designer/docker/Dockerfile is this folder. Allow-list: the image needs only the paperplot
# library (incl. fonts/ and themes/) and designer/. Never send figures/out, data, artifacts or caches.
*
!paperplot
!designer

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.cache
designer/data
# the Windows-native designer's live specs (its default state dir is designer/); the image seeds from designer/seeds
designer/specs
designer/tests/out
designer/tests/_tmp*
